    "narrative": "For July 5th, the LawDog lineup is headlined by **Taylor Ward** (71.46) and **Lawrence Butler** (70.17), our two premier plays of the day. **Taylor Ward** benefits immensely from the platoon advantage against Lodolo, capitalizing on an elevated +18% SP Skill adjustment due to the favorable matchup. Meanwhile, **Lawrence Butler** is anchored by an elite 10% park factor bump and a high-leverage cleanup spot against P\u00e9rez. Both hitters are positioned to anchor our Roto categories today, as their combined power-hitting profiles align perfectly with the projected deficiencies in their respective opposing starters. **Bryson Stott** (71.06) also warrants mention as a high-floor start; despite a minor penalty for his late-inning SB suppression risk, he remains a strong start due to an excellent +19% SP Skill projection against Avila.\n\nThe most difficult bench decision involved **Gavin Sheets**, who narrowly missed the cut at 47.41. While **Gavin Sheets** offers respectable platoon value against Sheehan, his efficiency ceiling is suppressed by a negative SP Skill adjustment. Ultimately, the optimizer favored the higher park-adjusted floors provided by the likes of **Jung Hoo Lee** and **Luis Arraez**, who benefit from a massive +14% park factor at their venue. We are also keeping a close eye on the SB category, where **Jung Hoo Lee**, **Daulton Varsho**, and **Drew Gilbert** all gain marginal value from \"Slow SP Delivery\" metrics, though we must navigate the risks posed by elite arms like Hancock, who forces **Daulton Varsho** into a marginal 53.89 rating. \n\nWith **Jos\u00e9 Ram\u00edrez** and **Will Smith** sidelined on the IL, our depth is tested. We remain cognizant that **Geraldo Perdomo** carries some risk against a capable arm in Sproat, though his +8% order adjustment keeps him firmly in the mix. As always, keep an eye on lineup adjustments for **Jeremiah Jackson** and **Drew Gilbert**; should either be pushed further down the order, we will rely on our bench reserves to protect our daily game caps.",
